ent","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Watch out. There are a lot of dangerous materials in the workroom.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"Engineering Department... Not bad. The head of the department, though... A bit too talkative.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"I like machines. They don't talk, but they're always honest with their readings.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"Chaos is only an enemy if you're unable to adapt.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"When the approaching chaos endangers your loved ones, the thing to do isn't to protect them. It's... to keep them as far away from you as possible.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"No, my comms equipment's fine. Nothing to worry.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"You want me to say something? Uh, that's the hardest part.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"My hometown? There... the sky is blue, and all the buildings under it are blue, too.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Good... I'll find something to do.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Rainbow Operator, codename Fuze. I've said everything I need to. Let's get to it.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"No problem. I'll find some time to watch them.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Good. Thank you.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Do I need to give some crowd a speech? No? Good.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"At your command.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Do exactly as I say.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Enough talk. Now we act.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Матрёшка готов поручить.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Focus on the task at hand.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Remember our objectives.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Lower your voice.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Remain silent.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"With me!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Remain alert.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Stay focused.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Hold position.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Every action builds our chances to win.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Asset secured.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"On your feet, your wounds are not fatal.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Move, right now!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"This place isn't bad.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Don't do that...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"I made some pilaf. Want some?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Hey...","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42}],"packs":[{"id":"linkage","label":"Collaboration","actors":["Gabriel Furman"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_4126_fuze/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}